%% GitOps reconciliation loop: Git ↔ Argo CD ↔ Kubernetes API server (pull model).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Git as GitHub<br/>timurdll/devops-labs
    participant Repo as argocd-repo-server
    participant Ctrl as argocd-application-controller
    participant API as kube-apiserver
    participant K8s as kube controllers / kubelet
    actor Op as Operator (prod)

    Dev->>Git: git push (environments/dev/values.yaml)
    Note over Git: desired state = commit SHA<br/>(single source of truth)

    loop every 30 s (timeout.reconciliation) — no inbound webhook into kind
        Ctrl->>Repo: GetManifests(app, targetRevision)
        Repo->>Git: git ls-remote / fetch week8-gitops-helm
        Git-->>Repo: HEAD = new SHA
        Repo->>Repo: helm template charts/shoplite<br/>values.yaml ⊕ environments/env/values.yaml ⊕ global.environment
        Repo-->>Ctrl: desired manifests (cached per SHA)
        Ctrl->>API: (watch cache) live objects of the Application
        Ctrl->>Ctrl: diff desired vs live → Synced / OutOfSync
    end

    alt dev, staging: automated sync (prune + selfHeal)
        Ctrl->>API: server-side apply changed objects, prune removed ones
    else prod: manual gate
        Ctrl-->>Op: status OutOfSync (diff visible in UI / CLI)
        Op->>Ctrl: argocd app sync shoplite-prod
        Ctrl->>API: server-side apply
    end
    API->>K8s: Deployment spec changed (new checksum/config)
    K8s->>K8s: RollingUpdate maxSurge 1 / maxUnavailable 0
    K8s-->>API: pods Ready, status updated
    API-->>Ctrl: watch events
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: health = Progressing → Healthy, sync = Synced @ SHA

    Note over API,Ctrl: Drift: kubectl scale / edit on a live object
    API-->>Ctrl: watch event (live ≠ desired)
    Ctrl->>API: selfHeal re-applies git state (dev, staging)
